{"id":53,"name":"النجم","transliteration":"An-Najm","translation_fr":"L'étoile","translation_en":"The Star","type":"meccan","total_verses":62,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"وَٱلنَّجۡمِ إِذَا هَوَىٰ","translation_fr":"Par l'étoile à son déclin","translation_en":"By the star when it descends","transliteration":"Waalnnajmi itha hawa"},{"id":2,"text":"مَا ضَلَّ صَاحِبُكُمۡ وَمَا غَوَىٰ","translation_fr":"Votre compagnon ne s'est pas égaré et n'a pas été induit en erreur","translation_en":"Your companion [Muhammad] has not strayed, nor has he erred","transliteration":"Ma dalla sahibukum wama ghawa"},{"id":3,"text":"وَمَا يَنطِقُ عَنِ ٱلۡهَوَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"et il ne prononce rien sous l'effet de la passion","translation_en":"Nor does he speak from [his own] inclination","transliteration":"Wama yantiqu AAani alhawa"},{"id":4,"text":"إِنۡ هُوَ إِلَّا وَحۡيٞ يُوحَىٰ","translation_fr":"ce n'est rien d'autre qu'une révélation inspirée","translation_en":"It is not but a revelation revealed","transliteration":"In huwa illa wahyun yooha"},{"id":5,"text":"عَلَّمَهُۥ شَدِيدُ ٱلۡقُوَىٰ","translation_fr":"Que lui a enseigné [l'Ange Gabriel] à la force prodigieuse","translation_en":"Taught to him by one intense in strength","transliteration":"AAallamahu shadeedu alquwa"},{"id":6,"text":"ذُو مِرَّةٖ فَٱسۡتَوَىٰ","translation_fr":"doué de sagacité; c'est alors qu'il se montra sous sa forme réelle [angélique]","translation_en":"One of soundness. And he rose to [his] true form","transliteration":"Thoo mirratin faistawa"},{"id":7,"text":"وَهُوَ بِٱلۡأُفُقِ ٱلۡأَعۡلَىٰ","translation_fr":"alors qu'il se trouvait à l'horizon supérieur","translation_en":"While he was in the higher [part of the] horizon","transliteration":"Wahuwa bialofuqi alaAAla"},{"id":8,"text":"ثُمَّ دَنَا فَتَدَلَّىٰ","translation_fr":"Puis il se rapprocha et descendit encore plus bas","translation_en":"Then he approached and descended","transliteration":"Thumma dana fatadalla"},{"id":9,"text":"فَكَانَ قَابَ قَوۡسَيۡنِ أَوۡ أَدۡنَىٰ","translation_fr":"et fut à deux portées d'arc, ou plus près encore","translation_en":"And was at a distance of two bow lengths or nearer","transliteration":"Fakana qaba qawsayni aw adna"},{"id":10,"text":"فَأَوۡحَىٰٓ إِلَىٰ عَبۡدِهِۦ مَآ أَوۡحَىٰ","translation_fr":"Il révéla à Son serviteur ce qu'Il révéla","translation_en":"And he revealed to His Servant what he revealed","transliteration":"Faawha ila AAabdihi ma awha"},{"id":11,"text":"مَا كَذَبَ ٱلۡفُؤَادُ مَا رَأَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"Le cœur n'a pas menti en ce qu'il a vu","translation_en":"The heart did not lie [about] what it saw","transliteration":"Ma kathaba alfuadu ma raa"},{"id":12,"text":"أَفَتُمَٰرُونَهُۥ عَلَىٰ مَا يَرَىٰ","translation_fr":"Lui contestez-vous donc ce qu'il voit","translation_en":"So will you dispute with him over what he saw","transliteration":"Afatumaroonahu AAala ma yara"},{"id":13,"text":"وَلَقَدۡ رَءَاهُ نَزۡلَةً أُخۡرَىٰ","translation_fr":"Il l'a pourtant vu, lors d'une autre descente","translation_en":"And he certainly saw him in another descent","transliteration":"Walaqad raahu nazlatan okhra"},{"id":14,"text":"عِندَ سِدۡرَةِ ٱلۡمُنتَهَىٰ","translation_fr":"près de la Sidrat-ul-Muntahâ","translation_en":"At the Lote Tree of the Utmost Boundary","transliteration":"AAinda sidrati almuntaha"},{"id":15,"text":"عِندَهَا جَنَّةُ ٱلۡمَأۡوَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"près d'elle se trouve le jardin de Ma'w","translation_en":"Near it is the Garden of Refuge","transliteration":"AAindaha jannatu almawa"},{"id":16,"text":"إِذۡ يَغۡشَى ٱلسِّدۡرَةَ مَا يَغۡشَىٰ","translation_fr":"au moment où le lotus était couvert de ce qui le couvrait","translation_en":"When there covered the Lote Tree that which covered [it]","transliteration":"Ith yaghsha alssidrata ma yaghsha"},{"id":17,"text":"مَا زَاغَ ٱلۡبَصَرُ وَمَا طَغَىٰ","translation_fr":"la vue n'a nullement dévié ni outrepassé la mesure","translation_en":"The sight [of the Prophet] did not swerve, nor did it transgress [its limit]","transliteration":"Ma zagha albasaru wama tagha"},{"id":18,"text":"لَقَدۡ رَأَىٰ مِنۡ ءَايَٰتِ رَبِّهِ ٱلۡكُبۡرَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"Il a bien vu certaines des grandes merveilles de son Seigneur","translation_en":"He certainly saw of the greatest signs of his Lord","transliteration":"Laqad raa min ayati rabbihi alkubra"},{"id":19,"text":"أَفَرَءَيۡتُمُ ٱللَّـٰتَ وَٱلۡعُزَّىٰ","translation_fr":"Que vous en semble [des divinités], Lât et Uuzzâ","translation_en":"So have you considered al-Lat and al-'Uzza","transliteration":"Afaraaytumu allata waalAAuzza"},{"id":20,"text":"وَمَنَوٰةَ ٱلثَّالِثَةَ ٱلۡأُخۡرَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"ainsi que Manât, cette troisième autre","translation_en":"And Manat, the third - the other one","transliteration":"Wamanata alththalithata alokhra"},{"id":21,"text":"أَلَكُمُ ٱلذَّكَرُ وَلَهُ ٱلۡأُنثَىٰ","translation_fr":"Sera-ce à vous le garçon et à Lui la fille","translation_en":"Is the male for you and for Him the female","transliteration":"Alakumu alththakaru walahu alontha"},{"id":22,"text":"تِلۡكَ إِذٗا قِسۡمَةٞ ضِيزَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"Que voilà donc un partage injuste","translation_en":"That, then, is an unjust division","transliteration":"Tilka ithan qismatun deeza"},{"id":23,"text":"إِنۡ هِيَ إِلَّآ أَسۡمَآءٞ سَمَّيۡتُمُوهَآ أَنتُمۡ وَءَابَآؤُكُم مَّآ أَنزَلَ ٱللَّهُ بِهَا مِن سُلۡطَٰنٍۚ إِن يَتَّبِعُونَ إِلَّا ٱلظَّنَّ وَمَا تَهۡوَى ٱلۡأَنفُسُۖ وَلَقَدۡ جَآءَهُم مِّن رَّبِّهِمُ ٱلۡهُدَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"Ce ne sont que des noms que vous avez inventés, vous et vos ancêtres. Allah n'a fait descendre aucune preuve à leur sujet. Ils ne suivent que la conjecture et les passions de [leurs] âmes, alors que la guidée leur est venue de leur Seigneur","translation_en":"They are not but [mere] names you have named them - you and your forefathers - for which Allah has sent down no authority. They follow not except assumption and what [their] souls desire, and there has already come to them from their Lord guidance","transliteration":"In hiya illa asmaon sammaytumooha antum waabaokum ma anzala Allahu biha min sultanin in yattabiAAoona illa alththanna wama tahwa alanfusu walaqad jaahum min rabbihimu alhuda"},{"id":24,"text":"أَمۡ لِلۡإِنسَٰنِ مَا تَمَنَّىٰ","translation_fr":"Ou bien l'homme aura-t-il tout ce qu'il désire","translation_en":"Or is there for man whatever he wishes","transliteration":"Am lilinsani ma tamanna"},{"id":25,"text":"فَلِلَّهِ ٱلۡأٓخِرَةُ وَٱلۡأُولَىٰ","translation_fr":"A Allah appartiennent la vie future et la vie d'ici-bas","translation_en":"Rather, to Allah belongs the Hereafter and the first [life]","transliteration":"Falillahi alakhiratu waaloola"},{"id":26,"text":"۞وَكَم مِّن مَّلَكٖ فِي ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ لَا تُغۡنِي شَفَٰعَتُهُمۡ شَيۡـًٔا إِلَّا مِنۢ بَعۡدِ أَن يَأۡذَنَ ٱللَّهُ لِمَن يَشَآءُ وَيَرۡضَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"Et que d'Anges dans les cieux dont l'intercession ne sert à rien, sinon qu'après qu'Allah l'aura permis, en faveur de qui Il veut et qu'Il agrée","translation_en":"And how many angels there are in the heavens whose intercession will not avail at all except [only] after Allah has permitted [it] to whom He wills and approves","transliteration":"Wakam min malakin fee alssamawati la tughnee shafaAAatuhum shayan illa min baAAdi an yathana Allahu liman yashao wayarda"},{"id":27,"text":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ لَا يُؤۡمِنُونَ بِٱلۡأٓخِرَةِ لَيُسَمُّونَ ٱلۡمَلَـٰٓئِكَةَ تَسۡمِيَةَ ٱلۡأُنثَىٰ","translation_fr":"Ceux qui ne croient pas en l'au-delà donnent aux Anges des noms de femmes","translation_en":"Indeed, those who do not believe in the Hereafter name the angels female names","transliteration":"Inna allatheena la yuminoona bialakhirati layusammoona almalaikata tasmiyata alontha"},{"id":28,"text":"وَمَا لَهُم بِهِۦ مِنۡ عِلۡمٍۖ إِن يَتَّبِعُونَ إِلَّا ٱلظَّنَّۖ وَإِنَّ ٱلظَّنَّ لَا يُغۡنِي مِنَ ٱلۡحَقِّ شَيۡـٔٗا","translation_fr":"alors qu'ils n'en ont aucune science: ils ne suivent que la conjecture, alors que la conjecture ne sert à rien contre la vérité","translation_en":"And they have thereof no knowledge. They follow not except assumption, and indeed, assumption avails not against the truth at all","transliteration":"Wama lahum bihi min AAilmin in yattabiAAoona illa alththanna wainna alththanna la yughnee mina alhaqqi shayan"},{"id":29,"text":"فَأَعۡرِضۡ عَن مَّن تَوَلَّىٰ عَن ذِكۡرِنَا وَلَمۡ يُرِدۡ إِلَّا ٱلۡحَيَوٰةَ ٱلدُّنۡيَا","translation_fr":"Ecarte-toi donc, de celui qui tourne le dos à Notre rappel et qui ne désire que la vie présente","translation_en":"So turn away from whoever turns his back on Our message and desires not except the worldly life","transliteration":"FaaAArid AAan man tawalla AAan thikrina walam yurid illa alhayata alddunya"},{"id":30,"text":"ذَٰلِكَ مَبۡلَغُهُم مِّنَ ٱلۡعِلۡمِۚ إِنَّ رَبَّكَ هُوَ أَعۡلَمُ بِمَن ضَلَّ عَن سَبِيلِهِۦ وَهُوَ أَعۡلَمُ بِمَنِ ٱهۡتَدَىٰ","translation_fr":"Voilà toute la portée de leur savoir. Certes ton Seigneur connaît parfaitement celui qui s'égare de Son chemin et Il connaît parfaitement qui est bien guidé","translation_en":"That is their sum of knowledge. Indeed, your Lord is most knowing of who strays from His way, and He is most knowing of who is guided","transliteration":"Thalika mablaghuhum mina alAAilmi inna rabbaka huwa aAAlamu biman dalla AAan sabeelihi wahuwa aAAlamu bimani ihtada"},{"id":31,"text":"وَلِلَّهِ مَا فِي ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَمَا فِي ٱلۡأَرۡضِ لِيَجۡزِيَ ٱلَّذِينَ أَسَـٰٓـُٔواْ بِمَا عَمِلُواْ وَيَجۡزِيَ ٱلَّذِينَ أَحۡسَنُواْ بِٱلۡحُسۡنَى","translation_fr":"A Allah appartient ce qui est dans les cieux et sur la terre afin qu'Il rétribue ceux qui font le mal selon ce qu'ils œuvrent, et récompense ceux qui font le bien par la meilleure [récompense]","translation_en":"And to Allah belongs whatever is in the heavens and whatever is in the earth - that He may recompense those who do evil with [the penalty of] what they have done and recompense those who do good with the best [reward]","transliteration":"Walillahi ma fee alssamawati wama fee alardi liyajziya allatheena asaoo bima AAamiloo wayajziya allatheena ahsanoo bialhusna"},{"id":32,"text":"ٱلَّذِينَ يَجۡتَنِبُونَ كَبَـٰٓئِرَ ٱلۡإِثۡمِ وَٱلۡفَوَٰحِشَ إِلَّا ٱللَّمَمَۚ إِنَّ رَبَّكَ وَٰسِعُ ٱلۡمَغۡفِرَةِۚ هُوَ أَعۡلَمُ بِكُمۡ إِذۡ أَنشَأَكُم مِّنَ ٱلۡأَرۡضِ وَإِذۡ أَنتُمۡ أَجِنَّةٞ فِي بُطُونِ أُمَّهَٰتِكُمۡۖ فَلَا تُزَكُّوٓاْ أَنفُسَكُمۡۖ هُوَ أَعۡلَمُ بِمَنِ ٱتَّقَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"ceux qui évitent les plus grands péchés ainsi que les turpitudes et [qui ne commettent] que des fautes légères. Certes, le pardon de Ton Seigneur est immense. C'est Lui qui vous connaît le mieux quand Il vous a produits de terre, et aussi quand vous étiez des embryons dans les ventres de vos mères. Ne vantez pas vous-mêmes votre pureté; c'est Lui qui connaît mieux ceux qui [Le] craignent","translation_en":"Those who avoid the major sins and immoralities, only [committing] slight ones. Indeed, your Lord is vast in forgiveness. He was most knowing of you when He produced you from the earth and when you were fetuses in the wombs of your mothers. So do not claim yourselves to be pure; He is most knowing of who fears Him","transliteration":"Allatheena yajtaniboona kabaira alithmi waalfawahisha illa allamama inna rabbaka wasiAAu almaghfirati huwa aAAlamu bikum ith anshaakum mina alardi waith antum ajinnatun fee butooni ommahatikum fala tuzakkoo anfusakum huwa aAAlamu bimani ittaqa"},{"id":33,"text":"أَفَرَءَيۡتَ ٱلَّذِي تَوَلَّىٰ","translation_fr":"Vois-tu celui qui s'est détourné","translation_en":"Have you seen the one who turned away","transliteration":"Afaraayta allathee tawalla"},{"id":34,"text":"وَأَعۡطَىٰ قَلِيلٗا وَأَكۡدَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"donné peu et a [finalement] cessé de donner","translation_en":"And gave a little and [then] refrained","transliteration":"WaaAAta qaleelan waakda"},{"id":35,"text":"أَعِندَهُۥ عِلۡمُ ٱلۡغَيۡبِ فَهُوَ يَرَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"Détient-il la science de l'Inconnaissable en sorte qu'il voit","translation_en":"Does he have knowledge of the unseen, so he sees","transliteration":"aAAindahu AAilmu alghaybi fahuwa yara"},{"id":36,"text":"أَمۡ لَمۡ يُنَبَّأۡ بِمَا فِي صُحُفِ مُوسَىٰ","translation_fr":"Ne lui a-t-on pas annoncé ce qu'il y avait dans les feuilles de Moïse","translation_en":"Or has he not been informed of what was in the scriptures of Moses","transliteration":"Am lam yunabba bima fee suhufi moosa"},{"id":37,"text":"وَإِبۡرَٰهِيمَ ٱلَّذِي وَفَّىٰٓ","translation_fr":"et celles d'Abraham qui a tenu parfaitement [sa promesse de transmettre]","translation_en":"And [of] Abraham, who fulfilled [his obligations]","transliteration":"Waibraheema allathee waffa"},{"id":38,"text":"أَلَّا تَزِرُ وَازِرَةٞ وِزۡرَ أُخۡرَىٰ","translation_fr":"qu'aucune [âme] ne portera le fardeau (le péché) d'autrui","translation_en":"That no bearer of burdens will bear the burden of another","transliteration":"Alla taziru waziratun wizra okhra"},{"id":39,"text":"وَأَن لَّيۡسَ لِلۡإِنسَٰنِ إِلَّا مَا سَعَىٰ","translation_fr":"et qu'en vérité, l'homme n'obtient que [le fruit] de ses efforts","translation_en":"And that there is not for man except that [good] for which he strives","transliteration":"Waan laysa lilinsani illa ma saAAa"},{"id":40,"text":"وَأَنَّ سَعۡيَهُۥ سَوۡفَ يُرَىٰ","translation_fr":"et que son effort, en vérité, lui sera présenté (le jour du Jugement)","translation_en":"And that his effort is going to be seen","transliteration":"Waanna saAAyahu sawfa yura"},{"id":41,"text":"ثُمَّ يُجۡزَىٰهُ ٱلۡجَزَآءَ ٱلۡأَوۡفَىٰ","translation_fr":"Ensuite il en sera récompensé pleinement","translation_en":"Then he will be recompensed for it with the fullest recompense","transliteration":"Thumma yujzahu aljazaa alawfa"},{"id":42,"text":"وَأَنَّ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ ٱلۡمُنتَهَىٰ","translation_fr":"et que tout aboutit, en vérité, vers ton Seigneur","translation_en":"And that to your Lord is the finality","transliteration":"Waanna ila rabbika almuntaha"},{"id":43,"text":"وَأَنَّهُۥ هُوَ أَضۡحَكَ وَأَبۡكَىٰ","translation_fr":"et que c'est Lui qui a fait rire et qui a fait pleurer","translation_en":"And that it is He who makes [one] laugh and weep","transliteration":"Waannahu huwa adhaka waabka"},{"id":44,"text":"وَأَنَّهُۥ هُوَ أَمَاتَ وَأَحۡيَا","translation_fr":"et que c'est Lui qui a fait mourir et qui a ramené à la vie","translation_en":"And that it is He who causes death and gives life","transliteration":"Waannahu huwa amata waahya"},{"id":45,"text":"وَأَنَّهُۥ خَلَقَ ٱلزَّوۡجَيۡنِ ٱلذَّكَرَ وَٱلۡأُنثَىٰ","translation_fr":"et que c'est Lui qui a crée les deux éléments de couple, le mâle et la femelle","translation_en":"And that He creates the two mates - the male and female","transliteration":"Waannahu khalaqa alzzawjayni alththakara waalontha"},{"id":46,"text":"مِن نُّطۡفَةٍ إِذَا تُمۡنَىٰ","translation_fr":"d'une goutte de sperme quand elle est éjaculée","translation_en":"From a sperm-drop when it is emitted","transliteration":"Min nutfatin itha tumna"},{"id":47,"text":"وَأَنَّ عَلَيۡهِ ٱلنَّشۡأَةَ ٱلۡأُخۡرَىٰ","translation_fr":"et que la seconde création Lui incombe","translation_en":"And that [incumbent] upon Him is the next creation","transliteration":"Waanna AAalayhi alnnashata alokhra"},{"id":48,"text":"وَأَنَّهُۥ هُوَ أَغۡنَىٰ وَأَقۡنَىٰ","translation_fr":"et c'est Lui qui a enrichi et qui a fait acquérir","translation_en":"And that it is He who enriches and suffices","transliteration":"Waannahu huwa aghna waaqna"},{"id":49,"text":"وَأَنَّهُۥ هُوَ رَبُّ ٱلشِّعۡرَىٰ","translation_fr":"Et c'est Lui qui est le Seigneur de Sirius","translation_en":"And that it is He who is the Lord of Sirius","transliteration":"Waannahu huwa rabbu alshshiAAra"},{"id":50,"text":"وَأَنَّهُۥٓ أَهۡلَكَ عَادًا ٱلۡأُولَىٰ","translation_fr":"et c'est Lui qui a fait périr les anciens 'Aad","translation_en":"And that He destroyed the first [people of] 'Aad","transliteration":"Waannahu ahlaka AAadan aloola"},{"id":51,"text":"وَثَمُودَاْ فَمَآ أَبۡقَىٰ","translation_fr":"ainsi que les Thamûd, et Il fit que rien n'en subsistât","translation_en":"And Thamud - and He did not spare [them]","transliteration":"Wathamooda fama abqa"},{"id":52,"text":"وَقَوۡمَ نُوحٖ مِّن قَبۡلُۖ إِنَّهُمۡ كَانُواْ هُمۡ أَظۡلَمَ وَأَطۡغَىٰ","translation_fr":"ainsi que le peuple de Noé antérieurement, car ils étaient encore plus injustes et plus violents","translation_en":"And the people of Noah before. Indeed, it was they who were [even] more unjust and oppressing","transliteration":"Waqawma noohin min qablu innahum kanoo hum athlama waatgha"},{"id":53,"text":"وَٱلۡمُؤۡتَفِكَةَ أَهۡوَىٰ","translation_fr":"de même qu'Il anéantit les villes renversées","translation_en":"And the overturned towns He hurled down","transliteration":"Waalmutafikata ahwa"},{"id":54,"text":"فَغَشَّىٰهَا مَا غَشَّىٰ","translation_fr":"Et les recouvrit de ce dont Il les recouvrit","translation_en":"And covered them by that which He covered","transliteration":"Faghashshaha ma ghashsha"},{"id":55,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكَ تَتَمَارَىٰ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de ton Seigneur mets-tu en doute","translation_en":"Then which of the favors of your Lord do you doubt","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbika tatamara"},{"id":56,"text":"هَٰذَا نَذِيرٞ مِّنَ ٱلنُّذُرِ ٱلۡأُولَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"Voici un avertisseur analogue aux avertisseurs anciens","translation_en":"This [Prophet] is a warner like the former warners","transliteration":"Hatha natheerun mina alnnuthuri aloola"},{"id":57,"text":"أَزِفَتِ ٱلۡأٓزِفَةُ","translation_fr":"l'Imminente (L'heure du Jugement) s'approche","translation_en":"The Approaching Day has approached","transliteration":"Azifati alazifatu"},{"id":58,"text":"لَيۡسَ لَهَا مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ كَاشِفَةٌ","translation_fr":"Rien d'autre en dehors d'Allah ne peut la dévoiler","translation_en":"Of it, [from those] besides Allah, there is no remover","transliteration":"Laysa laha min dooni Allahi kashifatun"},{"id":59,"text":"أَفَمِنۡ هَٰذَا ٱلۡحَدِيثِ تَعۡجَبُونَ","translation_fr":"Quoi! vous étonnez-vous de ce discours (le Coran)","translation_en":"Then at this statement do you wonder","transliteration":"Afamin hatha alhadeethi taAAjaboona"},{"id":60,"text":"وَتَضۡحَكُونَ وَلَا تَبۡكُونَ","translation_fr":"Et vous [en] riez et n'[en] pleurez point","translation_en":"And you laugh and do not weep","transliteration":"Watadhakoona wala tabkoona"},{"id":61,"text":"وَأَنتُمۡ سَٰمِدُونَ","translation_fr":"absorbés [que vous êtes] par votre distraction","translation_en":"While you are proudly sporting","transliteration":"Waantum samidoona"},{"id":62,"text":"فَٱسۡجُدُواْۤ لِلَّهِۤ وَٱعۡبُدُواْ۩","translation_fr":"Prosternez-vous donc à Allah et adorez-Le","translation_en":"So prostrate to Allah and worship [Him]","transliteration":"Faosjudoo lillahi waoAAbudoo"}]}